$L += '<p>Every season brings new opportunities for personalized gifting. Here is your year-round guide to custom gifts for every holiday and occasion.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Spring: Fresh Beginnings</h2>'
$L += '<p>Spring celebrations include Easter, Mother Day, and graduation season. Custom pastel-colored mugs, floral-print pillows, and personalized photo blankets make wonderful spring gifts that celebrate renewal and growth.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Summer: Fun in the Sun</h2>'
$L += '<p>Summer calls for custom t-shirts for vacations and outdoor events, personalized mugs for iced coffee lovers, and custom accessories for beach trips. Father Day and Independence Day are perfect occasions for themed custom gifts.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Fall: Cozy and Warm</h2>'
$L += '<p>Autumn is all about warmth and comfort. Custom fleece blankets, cozy pillows with fall designs, and seasonal mugs featuring autumn colors are perfect. Halloween and Thanksgiving bring more themed gift opportunities.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Winter: Holiday Magic</h2>'
$L += '<p>Winter is the peak gift-giving season. Christmas, Hanukkah, and New Year offer endless opportunities for personalized gifts. Custom ornaments, holiday-themed apparel, photo blankets, and festive mugs are always popular choices.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Year-Round Occasions</h2>'
$L += '<ul><li><strong>Birthdays:</strong> Custom gifts are always a hit for birthday celebrations.</li><li><strong>Anniversaries:</strong> Personalized items with dates and photos mark milestones beautifully.</li><li><strong>Weddings:</strong> Custom favors and gifts make wedding celebrations extra special.</li><li><strong>Just Because:</strong> Random acts of kindness with personalized gifts brighten any day.</li></ul>'
$L += '<h2>Conclusion</h2>'
$L += '<p>No matter the season, custom gifts add a personal touch that shows you care. Plan ahead for holidays and keep our <a href="../products/">product collection</a> in mind for year-round gifting inspiration.</p>'
$L += '</article></div></main>'
