$L += '<header><nav><div class="logo"><h1><a href="../index.html">CustomGiftLab</a></h1></div><ul class="nav-menu"><li><a href="../index.html">Home</a></li><li><a href="../products/">Products</a></li><li><a href="../guides/">Guides</a></li><li><a href="../blog/" class="active">Blog</a></li><li><a href="../about.html">About</a></li><li><a href="../contact.html">Contact</a></li></ul></nav></header>'
$L += '<main><section class="hero"><div class="hero-content"><h1>Custom Gift Packaging and Presentation Ideas</h1><p class="post-meta">May 20, 2024 | By CustomGiftLab Team</p></div></section>'
$L += '<div class="container"><article class="blog-content">'
$L += '<p>The presentation of a gift is almost as important as the gift itself. Creative packaging elevates the unboxing experience and shows extra thoughtfulness.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Gift Box Selection</h2>'
$L += '<p>Choose boxes that complement your custom gift. For mugs, use padded boxes with tissue paper. For t-shirts, fold neatly and place in decorative boxes. For pillows and blankets, use gift bags or wrapped boxes that match the occasion.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Wrapping Paper and Ribbons</h2>'
$L += '<p>Coordinate wrapping paper with the gift theme. Use ribbons, bows, and gift tags for an extra special touch. Consider using custom-printed wrapping paper with personal messages or photos.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Add Personal Touches</h2>'
$L += '<p>Include handwritten notes, dried flowers, or small complementary items in the packaging. These extras show that you put thought into every detail of the gift experience.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Eco-Friendly Packaging</h2>'
$L += '<p>Consider sustainable packaging options like recycled paper, fabric wraps, or reusable containers. These choices align with eco-friendly values and reduce waste.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Conclusion</h2>'
$L += '<p>Great packaging makes custom gifts even more memorable. By putting thought into presentation, you create a complete gift experience that delights recipients from the moment they see the package. Check our <a href="../guides/">design guides</a> for more tips on creating amazing custom gifts.</p>'
$L += '</article></div></main>'
